   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Twinning Domstolsverket Ukraine Fas 3 - EU Twinning Domstolsverket Ukraina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Twinning med Domstolsverket. Sidas st&#xf6;d inom detta beslut avser       Domstolsverkets kostnader f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rberedelse och genomf&#xf6;rande av        studiebes&#xf6;k inom Twinningprojektet &quot;Increased Effectiveness and       Management Capacities of Administrative Courts in Ukraine&quot; UA 10      ENP-PCA JH 21 (fas 3).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Twinning with Swedish National Courts Administration (SNCA). Sida&apos;s   support within this decision is intended for SNCA&apos;s costs for         preparations and implementation of study visits within the Twinning   Project &quot;Increased Effectiveness and Management Capacities of         Administrative Courts in Ukraine&quot; UA 10 ENP-PCA JH 21 (phase 3).</narrative>
  </description>
